The MVP is considered successful when the following flow works completely:

```text
Register Patient
      ↓
Perform Triage
      ↓
Classify Urgency
      ↓
Prioritize Queue
      ↓
Clinician Consultation
      ↓
Issue Prescription
      ↓
Search Medicine Availability
      ↓
Find Verified Pharmacy
      ↓
Reserve Medicine
      ↓
